  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c002",
   "line": "a2_c002_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "咦？／我想揮手……手怎麼跑到旁邊去了？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 13.45,
   "voice_start_s": 13.572,
   "diff_s": -0.122,
   "pass": true,
   "detect": "-40 dB／0.05 s",
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c002_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c002",
   "line": "a2_c002_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "叔叔，小心！",
   "subtitle_start_s": 21.48,
   "voice_start_s": 21.604,
   "diff_s": -0.124,
   "pass": true,
   "detect": "-40 dB／0.05 s",
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c002_02_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c003",
   "line": "a2_c003_01",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "還記得廣場上，／那個閃亮的小盒子嗎？",
   "subtitle_start_s": 1.45,
   "voice_start_s": 1.585,
   "diff_s": -0.135,
   "pass": true,
   "detect": "-40 dB／0.05 s",
   "audio": "audio/vo/vo_a2_c003_01_v04.wav"
  },
  {
   "cue": "a2_c003",
   "line": "a2_c003_02",
   "page": 1,
   "text": "有一種煙彈，外表像電子煙，／裡面卻可能加了毒品，",
   "subtitle_start_s": 5.88,
   "voice_start_s": 6.016,
